  "description": "One-KVM Rust 是一个用 Rust 编写的轻量级 IP-KVM 解决方案，可通过网络远程管理服务器和工作站，实现 BIOS 级远程控制。One-KVM Rust  is a lightweight IP-KVM solution written in Rust. It lets you manage servers and workstations over the network, including at BIOS level.",
